          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We are sure that you will be excited about the above results. You may repeat the process of preparing the extract and testing substances with some vegetables, fruits, or flowers, such as beetroot, purple cabbage, turmeric, Indian blackberry (jamun), and red hibiscus (gudhal) flower. They can also act as acid-base indicators."
